# Worker runtime vars/secrets for the dashboard dev server in apps/dashboard.
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (done for you by `pnpm run setup`); `.dev.vars` is
# gitignored and never committed. Never paste a real key into THIS file.
#
# ENVIRONMENT and API_URL come from `vars` in wrangler.jsonc. The file still
# exists on purpose: when `.dev.vars` is absent, wrangler loads this
# directory's `.env` as runtime vars instead, leaking the wrangler-side
# Hyperdrive connection string into `env`.
#
# Clerk (docs/secrets.md; Clerk application app_3K61mygiVkqZZcrltxAu8UpG5kx,
# development instance). Keys: https://dashboard.clerk.com → the ProofQL
# application → Configure → API keys; or `clerk env pull` with the Clerk CLI
# and move the values here.
#
# Leave CLERK_SECRET_KEY empty and, because ENVIRONMENT is "local", the app
# runs with the LOCAL AUTH STUB: every request acts as the seeded demo
# account (`pnpm seed`), a "Local auth stub" banner shows, and /sign-in
# redirects straight to /app. Fill both keys to exercise real Clerk sign-in,
# organizations, and the webhook locally (app/lib/account.server.ts).
CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
CLERK_SECRET_KEY=
# Signing secret of the Clerk webhook endpoint that points at
# <this app's origin>/webhooks/clerk (Clerk dashboard → Webhooks →
# the endpoint → Signing secret, `whsec_…`). Locally, `clerk webhooks listen
# --forward-to http://localhost:8799/webhooks/clerk` prints one. Empty ⇒
# the endpoint answers 503 and nothing else changes.
CLERK_WEBHOOK_SIGNING_SECRET=
# Signs the one-shot flash cookie that carries a success toast across an
# action's redirect (app/lib/flash.server.ts). Empty locally ⇒ a fixed
# dev-only secret; outside ENVIRONMENT=local the app refuses to start a
# flash without it (`wrangler secret put SESSION_SECRET`; docs/secrets.md).
SESSION_SECRET=
# Local auth stub only (CLERK_SECRET_KEY empty, ENVIRONMENT local): act as a
# different account than the seeded demo. Set it to any `org_…` string and the
# stub creates an empty account with that id on first load — the way to walk
# through the guided onboarding (#53) from a fresh account without Clerk.
# Ignored outside the stub.
AUTH_STUB_ORG_ID=
